{
    "title": "Location Tracker: GPS App",
    "description": "Location Tracker is a GPS tracking app that you can use on a cellphone to find your kids. Share location by using a shared, and protected private map.\r\n\r\nSmart Circles\r\nThe Smart Circles feature in our locator allows you to always have information on your kids whereabouts at your fingertips. This setting provides data on location history as well as real-time data. Simply use private link for family to find your children easily.\r\n\r\nGeo-fence zones\r\nGeozones allows you to be alerted in real-time when your child arrive at their destinations. Simply drop a pin on your mobile map to set the center of the geo-fence at a specific position. Next, name your geolocation. Follow up by setting the radius for it. Once your zones are created, push notifications will alert you when your circle members enter and exit. Geozones automatically let you know where your kids are without any action needed from them. This secure tracker ensures that you always have a tracker app on hand. \r\n\r\nEmergency SOS function\r\nHave you ever asked the question: how can child share whereabouts when he am in trouble? And how can i find my kids on map? How can children let my know that they am safe?\r\n\r\nWith link of family, your circle can locate you using a cell phone like a pro. The Emergency SOS function allows you to alert all members of your circles via urgent push notifications that you need help. It provides a live update of where you are. This family connect gives the security of having sharing a GPS tracker and parental control.\r\n\r\nOther features in this Location Tracker:\r\n- \u00abLink your family: Find your kids\u00bb on the mobile map in real-time.\r\n- View the history of each geozone circle member.\r\n- \u00abFind my device\u00bb by GPS to track the positioning of your phone/tablet.\r\n- Manage group circles and geo-fence zones.\r\n- More features are coming soon!\r\n\r\nLocation Tracker is your convenient GPS navigator to keep your kids safe. It makes life convenient and provides a glympse into innovative celular tracking. We have designed our app with care and our intention was to make the location sharing process easy, safe, and convenient.  Subscribe to our location finder for unlimited notifications, live tracking, longer location history, and no ads.\r\n\r\nTerms of use: https://tou.find-friends.pro\r\nPrivacy policy: https://pp.find-friends.pro",
    "descriptionHTML": "Location Tracker is a GPS tracking app that you can use on a cellphone to find your kids. Share location by using a shared, and protected private map.<br><br>Smart Circles<br>The Smart Circles feature in our locator allows you to always have information on your kids whereabouts at your fingertips. This setting provides data on location history as well as real-time data. Simply use private link for family to find your children easily.<br><br>Geo-fence zones<br>Geozones allows you to be alerted in real-time when your child arrive at their destinations. Simply drop a pin on your mobile map to set the center of the geo-fence at a specific position. Next, name your geolocation. Follow up by setting the radius for it. Once your zones are created, push notifications will alert you when your circle members enter and exit. Geozones automatically let you know where your kids are without any action needed from them. This secure tracker ensures that you always have a tracker app on hand. <br><br>Emergency SOS function<br>Have you ever asked the question: how can child share whereabouts when he am in trouble? And how can i find my kids on map? How can children let my know that they am safe?<br><br>With link of family, your circle can locate you using a cell phone like a pro. The Emergency SOS function allows you to alert all members of your circles via urgent push notifications that you need help. It provides a live update of where you are. This family connect gives the security of having sharing a GPS tracker and parental control.<br><br>Other features in this Location Tracker:<br>- \u00abLink your family: Find your kids\u00bb on the mobile map in real-time.<br>- View the history of each geozone circle member.<br>- \u00abFind my device\u00bb by GPS to track the positioning of your phone/tablet.<br>- Manage group circles and geo-fence zones.<br>- More features are coming soon!<br><br>Location Tracker is your convenient GPS navigator to keep your kids safe